SUMMARY:Dominican Republic: E-invoicing deadline for small\, micro and uncl
 assified taxpayers extended to 15 Nov 2026
DESCRIPTION:Deadline 15 Nov 2026. On 6 May 2026 the DGII granted a six-mont
 h extension under Law 32-23 on Electronic Invoicing: small\, micro and unc
 lassified taxpayers now have until 15 November 2026 (originally 15 May 202
 6) to implement electronic invoicing.\n\nSource: https://www.ey.com/es_ce/
 technical/tax/tax-alerts/republica-dominicana-dgii-otorga-prorroga-de-seis
 -meses-a-contribuyentes-identificados-como-pequenos-micros-y-no-clasificad
 os-para-la-implementacion-de-fe\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.e
 u/countries/dominican-republic.html#do-reporting\n\nFor information only\,
  not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
